{
  "mn14:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 14 ",
  "mn14:0.2": "Cūḷadukkhakkhandhasutta ",
  "mn14:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn14:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ nigrodhārāme. ",
  "mn14:2.1": "Atha kho mahānāmo sakko yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho mahānāmo sakko bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn14:2.2": "“dīgharattāhaṁ, bhante, bhagavatā evaṁ dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi: ",
  "mn14:2.3": "‘lobho cittassa upakkileso, doso cittassa upakkileso, moho cittassa upakkileso’ti. ",
  "mn14:2.4": "Evañcāhaṁ, bhante, bhagavatā dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi: ",
  "mn14:2.5": "‘lobho cittassa upakkileso, doso cittassa upakkileso, moho cittassa upakkileso’ti. ",
  "mn14:2.6": "Atha ca pana me ekadā lobhadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, dosadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, mohadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti. ",
  "mn14:2.7": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhante, evaṁ hoti: ",
  "mn14:2.8": "‘kosu nāma me dhammo ajjhattaṁ appahīno yena me ekadā lobhadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, dosadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, mohadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhantī’”ti. ",
  "mn14:3.1": "“So eva kho te, mahānāma, dhammo ajjhattaṁ appahīno yena te ekadā lobhadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, dosadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti, mohadhammāpi cittaṁ pariyādāy